act-list html head: <div class="train71-host"><p class="guide68-intro">為呢一日揀訓練：先揀想練嘅數值，再揀課程。得已報名嘅課程排得入；未報名嘅會用文字寫明去邊度報名。</p><div class="guide68-chips"><button type="button" class="guide68-chip on" data-gstat="acting">演技<span class="gv">22</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="stage">台風<span class="gv">17</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="vocal">歌藝<span class="gv">14</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="looks">外貌<span class="gv">22</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="charm">魅力<span class="gv">18</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="iq">智商<span class="gv">22</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="stamina">體能<span class="gv">75</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="fame">幕前聲望<span class="gv">16</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="popularity">人氣<span class="gv">9</span></button><button type="button" class="guide68-chip" data-gstat="stress">壓力<span class="gv">0</span></button></div><p class="t70-group">主修 · 主升演技</p><p class="train73-note">「演技訓練」未報名——去 星河電視台 報名。</p><p class="guide68-note">增益係每堂名義範圍；實際到手會按你而家嘅數值遞減（越練越難升，係行內規矩）。每課上滿 5 堂升一級（最高三級），加幅跟住級別提升；堂數累計夠數亦會開放其他課程。</p></div>
